# Line endings are pinned, not guessed. scripts/verify_close.py compares the sha256 of
# the seed CSVs against the fingerprint recorded in reports/gx_validation.json, so a
# CRLF checkout on one machine and LF on another would look like data drift.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.duckdb binary
